[gd_scene load_steps=4 format=3 uid="uid://unitdirshadowsplits"]

; Moves the split selection. The sun keeps Godot's default four splits, and the 0.04-wide bars span
; under one texel of a single map but about three of the first split's, so they stay crisp only
; while the near split draws. Every other shadow golden casts from bodies many texels wide or has an
; orthogonal sun, so a regression to one map or a wrong split selection is invisible there.

